{"step_index":218,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:35:11Z","thinking":"The \"Postpone\" condition appears to require $2,000,000 banked for a specific ending, while a user report suggests this isn't accurate. This discrepancy needs verification; the source of the funds is also unclear from the provided text. Considering these points, I suspect the provided text might contain an error.\n\n\nThe $2M figure appears to be the *reward* for a specific game ending, not a *requirement*. Examining the game data confirms this; the script assigns a $2,000,000 payout for the Bonnie & Clyde ending. The confusion likely arose from misinterpreting this reward as a prerequisite. It is the player's choice at a critical moment that determines which ending is achieved.\n\n\nEnding B (The Deal) does not have a $2M requirement; it involves accepting a plea deal for a smaller payout and a clean record, ending combat sooner. Ending C (The Sacrifice) requires one character to stay behind to allow the other to escape. Chapter 3 appears to contain parallel storylines. The player seems to choose between Tyrone, Dre/Boobie, Raul, and Tyrone mission strands, which converge at some point.\n\n\nExamining the mission structure, it appears three distinct strands (Tyrone, Boobie/Dre, Raul) emerge after a central mission. These strands involve cooldown periods, causing parallel map markers if played casually. Speedrunning reveals an interleaved pattern due to immediate contact calls upon mission completion, leading to a zigzag progression between the characters. These strands converge at the Sinfrontera National Bank heist scope out mission.\n\n\nThe mission structure confirms three parallel faction strands (Tyrone, Boobie/Dre'Quan, and Raul/Randy) after a central mission, converging at the Sinfrontera National Bank Heist (Mission 61). This explains the observed discrepancies regarding the $2,000,000 payout as a reward, not a requirement, and the non-linear structure of Chapter 3 missions. Need to update the mission flowchart to show the branching and convergence of these strands, clarifying the interleaved progression.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity-cli\\\\brain\\\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\\\\scratch\\\\build_speedrun_flowcharts.py\"","EndLine":"480","StartLine":"390","toolAction":"\"Inspecting Chapter 3 and 5 in speedrun flowchart script\"","toolSummary":"\"View Chapter 3 and 5 definitions\""}}]}
