{"step_index":226,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-24T23:36:01Z","thinking":"Updating the mission flow chart to reflect the parallel narrative strands in Chapter 3. The diagram will now illustrate a central \"spine\" of missions and three distinct faction storylines branching from it. These strands are Tyrone, Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan, and Raul Bautista & Randy, culminating in a convergence at Mission 61, the Sinfrontera National Bank Heist scope out.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update Chapter 3 parallel strands and flow in gta6_mission_flow_chart.md\"","EndLine":"165","Instruction":"\"Update Chapter 3 to accurately depict the 3 parallel faction strands and their convergence into the SNB Heist\"","ReplacementContent":"\"### Mechanics & Structure\\n- **Scope**: Largest chapter in the game (26 main missions).\\n- **Key Factions & The 3 Parallel Alliance Strands**: Upon completing *South Leonida Real Estate* (establishing the Vice City safehouse), three major alliance storylines unlock concurrently:\\n  1. **Tyrone Strand (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52.\\n  2. **Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan Strand (Syndicate & Nightclub)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56.\\n  3. **Raul Bautista & Randy Strand (Cartel Logistics & Exotic Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60.\\n- **Dynamic Interleaving vs. Concurrent Map Pins**: In casual play, waiting allows all three contacts to be active simultaneously as map pins. In speedrunning, finishing a mission places that contact on a brief cooldown timer while another contact rings, causing an optimal Any% runner to zigzag between Tyrone, Boobie, and Raul with zero downtime.\\n- **Major Heist**: **The Sinfrontera National Bank Heist**. All 3 strands converge at *Mission 61: Sinfrontera National Bank Scope Out*, unlocking the modular heist preparation board and culminating in *Mission 70: The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M Take).\\n\\n```mermaid\